## Data Source License

The dataset used in this project is based on Google Analytics e-commerce sample data
from BigQuery public datasets, which is provided for educational and demonstration
purposes under Google's terms of use.

This project transforms and analyzes the data for portfolio demonstration purposes.
The analysis, code, and documentation are provided under the MIT License above.

